{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]In the be[Bb]ginning God creat[Eb]ed the [Bb]heavens and the earth
[F]The [Bb]earth was formless and [Eb]empty darkness lay [Bb]over the deep
[F]The [Gm]Spirit of God [Eb]hovered over the [Bb]face of the wa[F]ters
